SUMMARY:The Proposal
DTSTAMP:20260816T033422Z
DTSTART:20260909T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:No Girls Night Out or Slumber Party would be complete without a
	 Sandra Bullock classic! She's the queen of versatility- from thrillers to
	 rom coms\, Sandy does it all! All while looking fabulously put together a
	nd effortlessly cool.    Join us for a fan favorite\, THE PROPOSAL\, and w
	atch Ryan Renolds fall for our girl through hilarious mishaps and overbear
	ing familial intrusion!\n\nhttps://rooftopcinemaclub.com/us/houston/uptown
	/screenings/the-proposal-23970\n\nFrom Rooftop Cinema Club Houston
